# rsync --filter-from 규칙: + include, - exclude
# 순서 중요 — 먼저 매칭된 규칙이 적용됨

# Obsidian & IDE system files
- .git/
- .obsidian/
- .idea/
- .makemd/
- .claude/
- .claude.json
- .links/

# Private & sensitive
- private/
- area/work/
- area/log/
- area/learning/
- area/career/interview-prep/
- area/career/portfolio-resume.md

# Project management (not for public)
- project/inbox/
- project/pending/
- project/active/2026-h1-learning-plan.md

# Deployment & server info (sensitive)
- project/active/linkwave/04-deployment/
- resource/topics/infrastructure/cors-cicd-deployment-troubleshooting.md
- resource/topics/aws/

# PARA structure (not for public)
- archive/
- templates/
- resource/daily/

# Vault navigation: 루트 index.md는 Quartz 홈 페이지로 유지, 나머지 제외
+ /index.md
- index.md

# MOC 파일: Obsidian 내부 탐색용, 블로그 불필요
- *MOC*.md

# Obsidian file types
- *.base
- *.url
- *.canvas

# Vault meta files
- CLAUDE.md
- GEMINI.md
- GEMINI-MCP-SETUP.md
- README.md
- PUBLISHING.md
- AUTOMATION-EXAMPLES.md
- VAULT-IMPROVEMENT-PLAN.md
- VAULT-TRANSFORMATION-COMPLETE.md
- daily-dev-document-style-guide.md
